From: FP mod <fpmod@localhost>
Date: Mon, 26 Oct 2026 22:11:54 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 12/30] LvlLimitBoostr: a rare find that raises a party
 Digimon's level limit by 1

With mystery encounters on: 1% of won ? battles offer it right after the
battle, and on 1% of floors with a ? one chest holds it. It is used at once:
a message box asks which party Digimon gets +1 to its level limit (only at its
limit, and below 99), or None. None from a chest leaves the chest closed with
the item still in it. Never kept in the bag, so saves stay compatible.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
